# Compile typed actions and queries against the real DOM/Core/Style: an
# action-only browser entry gate (native_dom.py says what it is not). The DOM
# public API needs C++23 std::expected, so the compiler is %dom_clang - the
# host compiler when it is Clang, else the pinned clang-std-embed.
# RUN: python3 %S/native_dom.py --translate ctjs-translate --opt ctjs-opt --clang %dom_clang --build %build --include %{monorepo}/ctbrowser/include --work %t --nm %nm
